    "created_at": "2022-10-03T22:31:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-03T22:31:38Z",
    "body": "Agreed that the EXIF orientation should be applied first, and that the flipY option should not override it, but be applied later.\r\n\r\nFeedback from early WebGPU users indicates that the flipY option is still needed in that API, so it turns out it's not just a WebGL-specific functionality but one needed in all of the imperative graphics APIs.\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
