    "body": "I traced \"disregard EXIF\" back through #741 to https://wiki.whatwg.org/wiki/ImageBitmap_Options which suggests it originates with @junov. Might well have been the output of a team discussion of course. (I agree that not disregarding EXIF makes more sense.)",
